  "title": "4-Digit by 1-Digit Multiplication Word Problems",
  "intro": "A four-digit factor can be split into thousands, hundreds, tens, and ones. Use those parts to calculate the area of a rectangular field, then connect the partial products to a shorter written multiplication method.",
